      },
      "message": "fix(pick): use one shared user-friendly name for picked geometry\n\nAdd a deterministic local-space feature naming table\n(`build_feature_names` and `classify_patch` in `geometry::feature`)\ncached per entity revision and facet allocation in `FeatureNamesMemo`\n(`pick::names`), and route every app, UI, chip, refusal, status line,\nand MCP pick response through it so no `0x` hex ids leak to users.\n\nFixes #2403",
